      "name": "Incite Insurrection",
      "category": "reaction",
      "placement": "bot",
      "activity": {
        "unit": "reaction",
        "number": 1,
        "symbol": "◈"
      },
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "Ioseff infuses the magic of his spell with the agonies of his own death. In addition to any effects caused by the triggering spell, the target must also attempt a DC 28 Fortitude save or contract internal insurrection at stage 1 (stage 2 on a critical failure); see page 67 for details of this eerie alien affliction."
      ],
      "trigger": "A creature within 30 feet of Ioseff fails a saving throw against one of his spells",
      "save": {
        "defense": "fortitude",
        "dc": 28,
        "basic": false,
        "outcomes": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Malevolent Possession",
      "category": "action",
      "placement": "bot",
      "activity": {
        "unit": "action",
        "number": 2,
        "symbol": "◆◆"
      },
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "As ghost, DC 28 Will save. A character who carries Fulvia's ring on their person gains a +4 item bonus to their save and treats the result of the save as one degree of success better than their rolled result. If Ioseff attempts to use this ability on a character who wears Fulvia's ring, he can attempt a Perception check against the ring-wearer's Stealth DC to notice the ring in time to avoid the attempt; on a success, he loses the two actions he took to make the attempt but avoids further effects. If he doesn't notice the ring and attempts to possess the ring-wearer, the ring-wearer automatically gains a critical success on their Will save, Ioseff is stunned 3, and he can't use Malevolent Possession again for 24 hours."
      ],
      "save": {
        "defense": "will",
        "dc": 28,
        "basic": false,
        "outcomes": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Phantasmal Amputation",
